    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Subterranean Anomaly Horror Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped deep beneath the earth in an  underground complex, you awaken to the echoing <i>beep</i> of a countdown. <strong>Explosives have been armed</strong>. The lights flicker. The walls breathe. You don\u2019t know how you got here\u2014but you do know one thing: when the music stops, so do you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a looping, ever-changing labyrinth where nothing stays the same for long. Shadows twist wrong. Objects duplicate. Faces lie. You're being watched, but you\u2019re not sure by what\u2014or <i>how many</i>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387100/extras/2595193d4b75d55f9a4b1b029b38c092.poster.avif?t=1750865422\" width=600 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387100/extras/2595193d4b75d55f9a4b1b029b38c092.webm?t=1750865422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387100/extras/2595193d4b75d55f9a4b1b029b38c092.mp4?t=1750865422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corridor may conceal an anomaly: some subtle, some grotesque. Identify them. Memorize patterns. Trust your instincts, not your eyes. The music is your timer, and once it ends... so does your chance to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you spot what shouldn't be there before it's too late?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387100/extras/72c9f9effb657cc6748453df99451a7e.poster.avif?t=1750865422\" width=600 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387100/extras/72c9f9effb657cc6748453df99451a7e.webm?t=1750865422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387100/extras/72c9f9effb657cc6748453df99451a7e.mp4?t=1750865422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> About the game<br>Play time<br>15 -60 mins<br>Over 18 Anomalies<br>Multiple endings</p>",
